  "scope": "The actual 128-slot rational-width controller reads both fields from the same original stored fraction, invokes each real trim/count child, then passes those literal returned size-word roots to the actual maximum selector. Its output is exactly BinaryFractionalGuesses.fractionWidth, with original raw fields and source retained on the same physical heap. The terminal-inclusive bound uses only original numerator and denominator lengths. Twelve actual physical cases include padded fields, zero numerators, unequal widths and carry growth. Row-width traversal, guess preparation and whole solver composition remain separate.",
